# Design Rules

Reference: `frontend/style.css` design tokens (Etherscan clarity + Vercel/Linear minimalism).

## Use
- CSS variables: `--accent`, `--surface`, `--border`, `--text-secondary`
- Inter + JetBrains Mono fonts
- Stat cards, data tables, sidebar navigation pattern
- Toasts for feedback; UIStates for loading/empty/error
- Theme: light/dark/system via ThemeManager
- High contrast: Accessibility toggle + accessibility.css

## Avoid
- Random colors outside token system
- Aurora/glass clutter (removed in Phase 4)
- Heavy animation — respect prefers-reduced-motion
- Inline styles except dynamic viz/education content

## Accessibility (required)
- Focus-visible rings, ARIA landmarks, table captions
- 44px min touch targets on primary controls
- See frontend/js/accessibility.js

Every view should feel clear and professional — educational first, not decorative.
